cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper and this archived release."
title: "ExplainableCropAI: Interpretable Deep Learning for Agricultural Disease Detection and Decision Support"
abstract: >-
  Code and reproducibility artifacts for ExplainableCropAI: a ConvNeXt V2-Tiny
  paddy-disease classifier coupled with Grad-CAM++ visual explanations, Monte
  Carlo Dropout uncertainty estimation, and grounded LLM-based natural-language
  explanations. Includes the model, explainers, uncertainty and recommendation
  modules, and the reproducible experiment scripts (leakage-controlled splits,
  explanation-method comparison, calibration, baselines/ablation). The Paddy
  Doctor dataset images are NOT redistributed here (per their license); only
  split/preprocessing/evaluation scripts and small sample files are included.
